> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT id FROM a187_gt ORDER BY p <-> point(250, 250) LIMIT 5
QUERY PLAN:text
Limit
  ->  Index Scan using a187_gt_p on a187_gt
        Order By: (p <-> '(250,250)'::point)
-- EXPLAIN

